//   - COMPUTE_TYPE_HIGH_FREQUENCY: HF - High Frequency (CPU-optimized, high clock speeds)
//   - COMPUTE_TYPE_HIGH_PERFORMANCE: HP - High Performance (next-gen CPUs, NVMe storage)
//   - COMPUTE_TYPE_GENERAL_PURPOSE: GP - General Purpose (balanced dedicated resources)
//   - COMPUTE_TYPE_CPU_OPTIMIZED: CPU - CPU Optimized (high CPU-to-memory ratio)
//   - COMPUTE_TYPE_MEMORY_OPTIMIZED: MEM - Memory Optimized (high memory-to-CPU ratio)
//   - COMPUTE_TYPE_STORAGE_OPTIMIZED: STO - Storage Optimized (high storage capacity)
//   - COMPUTE_TYPE_VERY_HIGH_FREQUENCY: VHF - Very High Frequency (highest clock dedicated CPUs)
